---
import { doctorProfile, profileFields } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="sobre-mi" class="section-premium">
  <div class="container-premium grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
    <div class="reveal relative min-h-[560px] overflow-hidden rounded-[44px] bg-gradient-to-br from-cream via-white to-[#e8f7f4] p-5 shadow-premium">
      <div class="absolute inset-8 rounded-[38px] border border-line/70"></div>
      <img
        class="absolute inset-5 h-[calc(100%-40px)] w-[calc(100%-40px)] rounded-[38px] object-cover object-center"
        src={doctorProfile.avatar}
        alt={`Retrato de ${doctorProfile.fullName}`}
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-5 rounded-[38px] bg-gradient-to-t from-navy/45 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-7 left-7 right-7 rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/82 p-5 shadow-soft backdrop-blur-xl">
        <b class="block text-xl text-ink">{doctorProfile.fullName}</b>
        <span class="text-sm font-bold text-muted">{doctorProfile.specialty} · {doctorProfile.location}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Sobre la doctora</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Una atencion medica que comienza por escuchar.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Cada persona llega a consulta con una historia diferente. Mi enfoque busca comprender de manera integral los sintomas, el contexto y las necesidades de cada paciente antes de definir un plan de tratamiento.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="my-8 border-l-2 border-gold pl-6 text-2xl font-black leading-tight text-navy">
        "No se trata unicamente de reducir sintomas, sino de comprender a la persona que los esta viviendo."
      </blockquote>
      <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {profileFields.map(([label, value]) => (
          <div class="rounded-[22px] border border-line bg-white/72 p-4">
            <span class="block text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-gold">{label}</span>
            <b class="mt-1 block text-sm text-ink">{value}</b>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
